# Zoose Quantum: one standalone lock (base + quantum together). Re-lock with ./lock-quantum.sh.
# Everything is unpinned and resolved to the newest compatible version. There are no caps.
# Strawberry Fields is not included: archived by Xanadu in January 2026, last PyPI release 2022-06-01.

